## Interface: 30300
## Title: Journal: Gear (alpha)
## Notes: Adds a Gear tab to the Journal: for your spec, every slot's way from what you wear to the best in slot, a step at a time - an easy item first, the best from dungeons, then each raid's - with where each drops and how likely, and the dungeon with the most upgrades for you. Follows your mod-individual-progression stage. /gear opens it.
